    "description": {
      "value": "\n<p><strong>Qliph-Scarred.</strong> You walked out of a place that should have unmade you. The hollows and fractures in your soul never fully closed, and the world can feel the pressure leaking out.</p><hr><p><em><strong>Qliph-Scarred Traits</strong></em></p><ul><li><p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Qliph-Scarred).</p></li><li><p><strong>Size.</strong> You are Medium.</p></li><li><p><strong>Speed.</strong> Your walking speed is 6 squares</p></li><li><p><strong>attributes.</strong> Your background determines your attribute increases; Qliph-Scarred does not grant any attribute bonuses.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Qliph-Scarred Core.</strong> At character creation you gain <strong>What Walked Out</strong> (Shadow Resilience, Qliphothic Saturation, Hunger Mask, Shadow-Wake). Your heritage adds its own traits and Tier powers at Initiation 1, 5, 11 and 17.</p>",
